/api.github.com/users/shuhand0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shuhand0","id":122648248,"login":"shuhand0","node_id":"U_kgDOB092uA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122648248?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shuhand0","id":122648248,"login":"shuhand0","node_id":"U_kgDOB092uA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuhand0","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\n\r\ndef f(x):\r\n  return jax.lax.argmax(x, 0, index_dtype=jnp.uint32)\r\n\r\nx = jnp.array([2, 3, 1])\r\n\r\n# Print lowered HLO\r\nprint(jax.jit(f).lower(x).as_text())\r\nprint(jax.jit(f)(x))\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details><summary>HLO</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\nmodule @jit_f attributes {mhlo.num_partitions = 1 : i32, mhlo.num_replicas = 1 : i32} {\r\n  func.func public @main(%arg0: tensor<3xi32> {mhlo.layout_mode = \"default\"}) -> (tensor<ui32> {jax.result_info = \"\", mhlo.layout_mode = \"default\"}) {\r\n    %0 = call @argmax(%arg0) : (tensor<3xi32>) -> tensor<ui32>\r\n    return %0 : tensor<ui32>\r\n  }\r\n  func.func private @argmax(%arg0: tensor<3xi32>) -> tensor<ui32> {\r\n    %0 = stablehlo.iota dim = 0 : tensor<3xui32>\r\n    %c = stablehlo.constant dense<-2147483648> : tensor<i32>\r\n    %c_0 = stablehlo.constant dense<0> : tensor<ui32>\r\n    %1:2 = stablehlo.reduce(%arg0 init: %c), (%0 init: %c_0) across dimensions = [0] : (tensor<3xi32>, tensor<3xui32>, tensor<i32>, tensor<ui32>) -> (tensor<i32>, tensor<ui32>)\r\n     reducer(%arg1: tensor<i32>, %arg3: tensor<i32>) (%arg2: tensor<ui32>, %arg4: tensor<ui32>)  {\r\n      %2 = stablehlo.compare  GT, %arg1, %arg3,  SIGNED : (tensor<i32>, tensor<i32>) -> tensor<i1>\r\n      %3 = stablehlo.compare  NE, %arg1, %arg1,  SIGNED : (tensor<i32>, tensor<i32>) -> tensor<i1>\r\n      %4 = stablehlo.or %2, %3 : tensor<i1>\r\n      %5 = stablehlo.compare  EQ, %arg1, %arg3,  SIGNED : (tensor<i32>, tensor<i32>) -> tensor<i1>\r\n      %6 = stablehlo.compare  LT, %arg2, %arg4,  UNSIGNED : (tensor<ui32>, tensor<ui32>) -> tensor<i1>\r\n      %7 = stablehlo.and %5, %6 : tensor<i1>\r\n      %8 = stablehlo.or %4, %7 : tensor<i1>\r\n      %9 = stablehlo.select %4, %arg1, %arg3 : tensor<i1>, tensor<i32>\r\n      %10 = stablehlo.select %8, %arg2, %arg4 : tensor<i1>, tensor<ui32>\r\n      stablehlo.return %9, %10 : tensor<i32>, tensor<ui32>\r\n    }\r\n    return %1#1 : tensor<ui32>\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nFails with:\r\n\r\n```\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/Users/jonatanklosko/git/nx/exla/tmp/jax_dbg_mps.py\", line 156, in <module>\r\n    print(jax.jit(f)(x))\r\njaxlib.xla_extension.XlaRuntimeError: UNKNOWN: <unknown>:0: error: type of return operand 0 ('tensor<si32>') doesn't match function result type ('tensor<ui32>') in function @main\r\n<unknown>:0: note: see current operation: \"func.return\"(%6) : (tensor<si32>) -> ()\r\n```\r\n\r\nCurrently jax-metal matches on the reduce IR and rewrites into specific argmax, perhaps it should add a convert if the output type is different.\r\n\r\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\r\n\r\n```\r\njax:    0.4.26\r\njaxlib: 0.4.26\r\nnumpy:  1.26.4\r\npython: 3.10.8 (main, Nov 16 2022, 12:45:33) [Clang 14.0.0 (clang-1400.0.29.202)]\r\njax.devices (1 total, 1 local): [METAL(id=0)]\r\nprocess_count: 1\r\nplatform: uname_result(system='Darwin', node='chonker', release='23.5.0', version='Darwin Kernel Version 23.5.0: Wed May  1 20:12:58 PDT 2024; root:xnu-10063.121.3~5/RELEASE_ARM64_T6000', machine='arm64')\r\n```\r\n\r\njax-metal 0.0.7","closed_at":"2024-06-12T10:31:17Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17034772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonatanklosko","id":17034772,"login":"jonatanklosko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDM0Nzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"