":13013577607,"intent":null,"node_id":"AE_lADOCTkjjc6K1OU9zwAAAAMHq2-H","performed_via_github_app":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/13013577607"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17034772?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jonatanklosko","id":17034772,"login":"jonatanklosko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDM0Nzcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jonatanklosko","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2024-06-05T07:10:40Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"This integrates the PjRt plugin from the [`jax-metal`](https://developer.apple.com/metal/jax/) for running on the Apple GPU. To test it, one can set `client: :mps` on EXLA backend/compiler. Since the plugin is loaded as a separate dynamic library, it can be tested without any changes to XLA (just make sure to remove the `cache/` directory).\r\n\r\nCertain computations can already be run, but the plugin is still very much incomplete. This PR is a room for experimentation and is meant to track the plugin progress. I reported a number of issues upstream, comments in the code point to those. In a few places I applied workarounds as temporary solutions or just to avoid VM crashes (segfaults), those are marked with a TODO.\r\n\r\n### Issues\r\n\r\nFor tracking purposes, here is a list of the Metal plugin issues reported upstream:\r\n\r\n**Crucial**\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21552\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21601\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21547\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21590\r\n\r\n**Not implemented**\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21387\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21384\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21554\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21389\r\n* Support for complex https://github.com/google/jax/issues/16416\r\n* Support for float-64 https://github.com/google/jax/issues/20938\r\n\r\n**Edge cases**\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21577\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21397\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21393\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21392\r\n* https://github.com/google/jax/issues/21821\r\n\r\nAll issues: [link](https://github.com/google/jax/issues?page=1&q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aopen+label%3A%22Apple+GPU+%28Metal%29+plugin%22).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n*Note: this PR is against the jk-s32 branch, which changes the default integer precision to 32 bits. This is a planned change (#1491), but it's not integrated yet to avoid conflicts with other work in progress.*","closed_at":"2026-01-20T18:46:18Z","comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elixir-nx/nx/issues/1504/comments","created_at":"2024-06-05T07:10:40Z","draft":true,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elixir-nx/nx/issues/1504/events","html_url":"https://github.com/elixir-nx/nx/pull/1504","id":2335085259,"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elixir-nx/nx/issues/1504/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEl5X1c5xgrzF","number":1504,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pull_request":{"diff_url":"https://github